      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7177/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bread pieces into an 8-inch square baking dish. Drizzle melted butter over bread and sprinkle raisins over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ja4skT0xvvUJZOLG2gU2EldgaSQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-7177-Bread-Pudding-II-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-a76c9c065b164dd1ae7e4d64381aab4d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7177/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk milk, sugar, eggs, cinnamon, and vanilla together in a medium mixing bowl until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Yg8semkS_VZiuDqy5q6P1iWNUeg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-gw-7177-Bread-Pudding-II-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-0ab22677b0e04acf9c9fc2b60e22d69f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7177/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture over bread and press gently with a fork until bread is covered and soaked.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
